{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45483","headline":"送新平故人 · 怀楚","name":"送新平故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常听仓庚思旧友，又因蝴蝶梦生涯。\n一千余里河连郭，三十六峰寒到家。\n阴岛直分东虢雁，晴楼高入上阳鸦。\n姜嫄庙北与君别，应笑薄寒悲落花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"怀楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}